    <bpmn:process id="W_W1634" name="W1634. Vendor Product Recall Return &amp; Recovery Processing" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: Product recall decision from W1615
Frequency: Per recall event (~1–2/year)
Volume: Variable — can involve thousands of units across 200 stores and 4 DCs
Owner: DC Returns Coordinator
Participants: DC Returns Coordinator, Store Managers, Compliance Officer, Buyer, Controller
Source: workflow W1634 — Vendor Product Recall Return &amp; Recovery Processing</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:laneSet id="W1634_LaneSet4">
        <bpmn:lane id="W1634_Lane1" name="Compliance Officer">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W1634_Task6</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W1634_Start5</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
        <bpmn:lane id="W1634_Lane2" name="DC Returns Coordinator">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W1634_Task7</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W1634_Task8</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
        <bpmn:lane id="W1634_Lane3" name="Controller">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W1634_Task9</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W1634_End10</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
      </bpmn:laneSet>
      <bpmn:startEvent id="W1634_Start5" name="Product recall decision from W1615">
        <bpmn:outgoing>W1634_Flow13</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W1634_Task6" name="Compliance Officer provides recall scope to DC Returns Coordinator: affected…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: Compliance Officer provides recall scope to DC Returns Coordinator: affected SKUs, lot/batch numbers, quantity to recover from stores and DCs
Responsible (R): Compliance Officer
Accountable (A): VP Supply Chain
Duration: Per W1616</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W1634_Flow13</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W1634_Flow13</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W1634_Task7" name="DC Returns Coordinator consolidates recalled product from DCs and stores: (a)…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: DC Returns Coordinator consolidates recalled product from DCs and stores: (a) DC: recalled product pulled from warehouse per W1616.3, (b) stores: recalled product consolidated and shipped to designated DC (store-to-DC reverse logistics), (c) customer returns of recalled product routed to designated DC
Responsible (R): DC Returns Coordinator
Accountable (A): VP Supply Chain
Duration: Variable</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W1634_Flow14</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W1634_Flow14</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W1634_Task8" name="Return to vendor">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: Recalled product disposition at DC: (a) Return to vendor: if vendor accepts return and provides credit — prepare consolidated RTV shipment per W1631, (b) Destroy: if product is unsafe for any use — arrange DENR-compliant destruction for chemicals or general destruction for non-hazardous items; document with destruction certificate, (c) Hold for investigation: retain samples for Quality Manager and Legal investigation
Responsible (R): DC Returns Coordinator / Quality Manager
Accountable (A): VP Supply Chain
Duration: Variable</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W1634_Flow15</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W1634_Flow15</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W1634_Task9" name="Financial recovery: (a) Controller calculates total recall cost (product +…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 4: Financial recovery: (a) Controller calculates total recall cost (product + handling + disposal + customer refunds), (b) Buyer negotiates vendor recovery: full credit, partial credit, or replacement, (c) insurance claim if applicable per W837, (d) unrecovered costs recorded as quality cost per W1614
Responsible (R): Controller / Buyer
Accountable (A): CFO / VP Merchandising
Duration: Per recall event</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W1634_Flow16</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:endEvent id="W1634_End10" name="Complete">
        <bpmn:incoming>W1634_Flow17</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:endEvent>
      <bpmn:textAnnotation id="W1634_Annotation11">
        <bpmn:text>Controls: - CTL-338 (ensure controlled execution — Vendor Returns &amp; Recovery (PA-32.2).) | - operational: standard operating procedures; system-enforced validation rules
Owner: DC Returns Coordinator</bpmn:text>
      </bpmn:textAnnotation>
      <bpmn:association id="W1634_Assoc12" sourceRef="W1634_Annotation11" targetRef="W1634_Start5" associationDirection="None" />
